<sn><md>#### Body Mass Index Categories 

Male &amp; Female

![chart](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nh-em0n/QDoc/main/BCS/General%20Science/B.Z.Food%20and%20Nutrition/assets/BMI_chart.jpeg)

| Category | BMI Range |
| --- | --- |
| **less weight** | $&lt; 18.5$ |
| **correct weight** | $18.5 - 24.9$ |
| **over weight** | $25 - 29.9$ |
| **fatty** | $\ge 30$ |


*BMI* is the `indicator of fat` in our body. 
Note that BMI is not the only or most accurate indicator of health, but it is widely used.</md></sn>